      "name": "Find your size",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Adds a \"Find your size\" button under the size option. It opens a side panel with a ring size finder and a size chart. Only shows on products whose size option is numeric."
